{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Of the sons of Shecaniah, of the sons of Parosh:</b> The correct reading is \"of the sons of Parosh,\" and it says so to distinguish Shecaniah's son, Jehizkel." "<b>And with him, who were registered by males:</b> Who were registered by themselves, the males, and they were one hundred and fifty."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:42:12.389226621Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}